            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Hell</h2>Please note that Escape the Loop is currently stuck in development hell, and as such, it is unfortunately no longer in active development. We truly hope this will change at some point in the future.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/f796fc50b6f4e371aa24f446a2f9f933.avif?t=1729676878\" width=618 height=101 /></span><br><br>What if I told you, we've done this before? You've read this text, you've looked at these screenshots, and you've watched this trailer. Not once, but a hundred times. Maybe even more. And in five minutes, you won't remember any of it – and do it all over again.<br><br>Escape the Loop is an open-world adventure game about time and recollection. You're stuck in a time loop – after five minutes, the world goes back to its initial state. Everything resets. You keep nothing. Except your memory of past loops. Every loop will be exactly the same, unless you change it through your actions. Use your knowledge of previous loops to find out what causes the time disruptions and break free once and for all.<br><br>Escape the Loop is funded with the generous support of the Creative Europe Programme - MEDIA of the European Union and the FFF Bayern.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/c82b809bb39a9bd744d0756ee9afcd76.avif?t=1729676878\" width=440 height=70 /></span><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/27b9c1f39a7d8ef4c67b03a486439904.avif?t=1729676878\" width=440 height=86 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Hell</h2>Please note that Escape the Loop is currently stuck in development hell, and as such, it is unfortunately no longer in active development. We truly hope this will change at some point in the future.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/f796fc50b6f4e371aa24f446a2f9f933.avif?t=1729676878\" width=618 height=101 /></span><br><br>What if I told you, we've done this before? You've read this text, you've looked at these screenshots, and you've watched this trailer. Not once, but a hundred times. Maybe even more. And in five minutes, you won't remember any of it – and do it all over again.<br><br>Escape the Loop is an open-world adventure game about time and recollection. You're stuck in a time loop – after five minutes, the world goes back to its initial state. Everything resets. You keep nothing. Except your memory of past loops. Every loop will be exactly the same, unless you change it through your actions. Use your knowledge of previous loops to find out what causes the time disruptions and break free once and for all.<br><br>Escape the Loop is funded with the generous support of the Creative Europe Programme - MEDIA of the European Union and the FFF Bayern.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/c82b809bb39a9bd744d0756ee9afcd76.avif?t=1729676878\" width=440 height=70 /></span><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/565760/extras/27b9c1f39a7d8ef4c67b03a486439904.avif?t=1729676878\" width=440 height=86 /></span>",
